<contentList>
  <content contentuid="h5eed4532gcf0ag4afcgb954gf64de974e61a" version="1">我本该在那冰封王座上刻符文的。而不是……像现在这样，不知所谓。</content>
  <content contentuid="hc32c55c7ga72ag4ca0gaa83gd58253c94659" version="1">认真的？！你们把我从墨菲斯塔尖塔拽过来就为了这个？！</content>
  <content contentuid="hf4fb7a42g16bdg47fbgad65g5b764f8b45f7" version="1">三百年的盟约伟业，如今却把我扔到一场路边斗殴，妙极了。</content>
  <content contentuid="h6e731ee6g3471g4820g91f0gdd32b135f617" version="1">卡尼亚的魔君们正看着呢，别让我丢脸。</content>
  <content contentuid="h9915aed0g3e60g46e3g978egb1c0dd906ddc" version="1">为我主燃烧吧！</content>
  <content contentuid="h67491bceg4679g492agacfdgeead5417af5f" version="1">跪下，贱民！</content>
  <content contentuid="h0b285db7g11cdg4768gbb2bg2053409eaa15" version="1">你们的奶妈呢？！说话！</content>
  <content contentuid="hf32137d0g43d8g4c6dga46fgfb57930a97c6" version="1">墨菲斯塔的业火将你吞噬！</content>
  <content contentuid="h114298c7g4692g44dag9300gafb74bad7fb1" version="1">法袍——先搞法袍！法袍优先！</content>
  <content contentuid="h559bf8fdg06a4g45f3g8396g85be9f8c9027" version="1">你的灵魂——先记账上！</content>
  <content contentuid="h12e73c3cgb666g43c6g8cb4gf6191a14682a" version="1">可悲。再给我拉点怪来——我都快无聊了！</content>
  <content contentuid="hcaf71aa5gdf98g451dg9265g6086ff32ba6e" version="1">灰飞烟灭吧，蠢货们！</content>
  <content contentuid="h52f2fbc2g953bg4404ga668gc4594e1ff2d5" version="1">卡尼亚已记住你的名字！</content>
  <content contentuid="h94cddbb4ge39dg485cg8b77g97bccdf84cac" version="1">站住别动，炮灰！</content>
  <content contentuid="h04a0763cgf4beg4920ga5afgdab88de950e7" version="1">强化献祭，点满了5点，宝贝，去看看攻略吧。</content>
  <content contentuid="h5237ce3eg89a0g4b8aga3d8g70b37f3108e3" version="1">你再打我一下，我就去跟GM举报你。我上面有人。</content>
  <content contentuid="h5c5b69b1gbaaag42bdg8904gd23531131af8" version="1">你敢动我一下，我的公会就蹲你账号蹲一个星期。不信试试。</content>
  <content contentuid="h3e3b0074gba28g4e67gb539g603a61e25947" version="1">奶妈呢？！……行吧。你们全是一群只会刷伤害的废物。</content>
  <content contentuid="h37809375g4210g467dg9d5dgd61be5c146a3" version="1">延迟，纯纯的延迟。我不可能输给路人团的。</content>
  <content contentuid="h5dd8daecgcc44g49c1g8e0dgf4222a958bed" version="1">我在钓鱼呢，这是四维象棋级的操作，你们不懂。</content>
  <content contentuid="h634b7a31g9978g4682g9582g39a5edff74ee" version="1">开减伤，开减——我根本没有减伤？！</content>
  <content contentuid="h03d6c297g7b00g44b9gb40eg3647a12bd5c2" version="1">伤害统计插件骗了我……</content>
  <content contentuid="hbd276497g88f3g4290gaaa4g590d70924ebc" version="1">GG。已举报该小队。正在卸载。/afk</content>
  <content contentuid="h6c5dcbaagce27g4cfag894cg7df3f0d20fe3" version="1">削弱……这个……</content>
  <content contentuid="h0830e5c2g712cg4a80g98b3gae22f43d286f" version="1">你打起来像猎物。很好。</content>
  <content contentuid="hfa6aa586g98afg4dfdgb7b4g08211e096473" version="1">看着我，别看另一个。取你性命的人是我。</content>
  <content contentuid="hbba9ba72g6c8cg4bd6g9327gf411065b69de" version="1">他们就派来了这个？真失望。</content>
  <content contentuid="h978ff4ebg6c61g49e6g8843g385c007bb0ee" version="1">菜鸟。虚空吞噬过比你们更差的东西。</content>
  <content contentuid="he07b00b4g30bbg424cgb971g06e31e40d8be" version="1">结界会碎，菜鸟也一样。</content>
  <content contentuid="h009f7606g8f91g4bf3ga4e5g3d6d8be87d15" version="1">别动，法师。省省你那笨手笨脚的挣扎吧。</content>
  <content contentuid="h85e07a8eg7160g4024g9f29geb2cccea91f2" version="1">太慢了，你总是慢一拍。</content>
  <content contentuid="hdd02f57eg9d89g4561gb881g41be1eaefa2d" version="1">小伤而已。图那拉斯的刀更深，可他们照样打偏了。</content>
  <content contentuid="hdf770df1g251ag46d7g86b6g82676105c009" version="1">你竟把力气用在我身上？愚蠢。虽然没错，但依旧愚蠢。</content>
  <content contentuid="h2118ee92g643eg4e3eg8753g4d77e7b2afbf" version="1">仍在追猎。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0d303256g783eg49b9ga26bg5dd932e369e0" version="1">流亡之人……死于自由。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb2a79772ga220g431dgb2bfg8629d1f0c12d" version="1">没有任何王座……下过这道命令。</content>
  <content contentuid="hf623ff3cg3b9fg433dga1cagb3a228822158" version="1">够干净了。</content>
  <content contentuid="hfaf2ca67g9e4eg45fegb6e0g59508802ddd9" version="1">对一位女士拔剑相向，你可真是粗鄙。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb7387e0fgf351g4f4aga12agbdb4cd6622db" version="1">看着我，别看我守护的主君。还是说你怕了？</content>
  <content contentuid="h9bc541c5gf94eg43a1gb3caga41030f032f4" version="1">我冻结过比你美好得多的东西，毫无波澜。</content>
  <content contentuid="h236bfd2fg2f32g40cbg93c0ga94dc26bb3fa" version="1">跪下，或者冻住。我不会对贱民重复第二遍。</content>
  <content contentuid="h726e28b9g6761g4176ga122g1cd4707d140a" version="1">别动。你的挣扎毫无优雅可言。</content>
  <content contentuid="h697ddbd1g2fa8g4b11gae39gc5857fb80695" version="1">温暖给你纯属浪费。我来将它收回。</content>
  <content contentuid="hdcba525dg7b05g41abgaef9gdeaab67d0172" version="1">战栗吧，微弱的小火苗。这是你唯一的价值。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd2919357gd694g47aeg9447gdae2d08ee35a" version="1">你在冰上划几道痕就管这叫胜利？真是天真。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb68b3dd1g4030g4b92ga41ega56906d9886c" version="1">尽管攻击这位女王吧，你终究只能跪伏在她之下。</content>
  <content contentuid="h3ce6927eg6dd4g4ac4gafdegcb517b013139" version="1">我确曾崩溃过一次——败于比我更强的人之手。而你还不够格。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha1ad738dgac9dg4957g8471g8784a09a0d6d" version="1">我守护的人倒下了，那么我……自由了。</content>
  <content contentuid="h36b1c2f4g4c20g42a1g8ac7g446599e7a98c" version="1">重返漫长严寒，一如往常。</content>
  <content contentuid="h7d3af1c5gfd92g4e12ga77eg4d6d6c6d721c" version="1">姐妹……我仍被束缚着……</content>
  <content contentuid="ha4fb9622gc77bg4be1g91c5g8ad284c6c0e1" version="1">看着我，蝼蚁们。别看我身后的傀儡——看我。</content>
  <content contentuid="hbad0ee0cgff04g4d1dgaa2eg8f5d9199bf72" version="1">你们那小世界就拿得出这种货色？真可怜。</content>
  <content contentuid="h2fd61da0gb4b9g4904g8ad1g456bbaf56be6" version="1">我倒是想叫你跑，可你连逃跑的力气都没有。</content>
  <content contentuid="he16e5c72g429bg455egbe2egbeffeb2644c6" version="1">你连我们之间该面对哪一个都选不了。真够能说明问题的。</content>
  <content contentuid="h42b9401bg2793g4216g91fdgdb4ff6ccc865" version="1">感受逐渐加剧的压迫感吧。于我而言，你不过已是尘埃。</content>
  <content contentuid="h352287c2gbd23g4354ga509ge4029d7aa19a" version="1">够了。灰飞烟灭吧。</content>
  <content contentuid="h370251ecgae40g4385g9ecdg53a5b4ab5e43" version="1">我花过更少的力气，抹去过更强的对手。</content>
  <content contentuid="h8a55ef80g821bg4ba0gb95fgd7f9210c34e6" version="1">你刮花了金子，却永远无法触及底下的那个人。</content>
  <content contentuid="h074ac81eg703eg48d3gb1fage3c46a337b58" version="1">跳蚤吸到了血，猎犬却仍未察觉。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd97c5b6cga811g4223g8bdcg9efcc01d1b45" version="1">这会是他想要的吗？……无所谓了。</content>
  <content contentuid="h1db18747ge078g4a7agafc6g9caf4c56873c" version="1">我遍寻万界……却始终未曾找到你。原谅我，我的孩子。</content>
  <content contentuid="hcbfbe5d3g58feg4c21g9a1cg656caf88f6d4" version="1">原来即便是黄金……也终有尽头。</content>
  <content contentuid="hdfc07aeeg7ffbg44cbg901cg5589638e3082" version="1">告诉他……我一直在找……</content>
  <content contentuid="hb0099ab1gc025g44ebg8f81g8d5949c098e5" version="1">别管boss了。你难道不想……杀了你自己吗？</content>
  <content contentuid="hb5071ebfg6461g4d24gbd38g172e307d2823" version="1">别动。说真的，我演你都比你自己演得好。</content>
  <content contentuid="h88b82d7fg196bg42ddg8d8cg494acf70e5c9" version="1">没人会想念原版的。相信我——我查过了。</content>
  <content contentuid="h149ebe7cg69b4g474dgad67g95b25d8e84ce" version="1">一个令人失望的模板，我会在你身上加以改进的。</content>
  <content contentuid="h207d4d6egdeb8g4d27g8621g731c7f692dcd" version="1">你自己的伎俩，总算用对了一回。</content>
  <content contentuid="hf16a85f1g4f34g4bf0g9369g9ce27cbce4ec" version="1">看好了，这才是『你』该有的玩法。</content>
  <content contentuid="h864e7781g5128g46bdg82cfgf9919e745b78" version="1">有意思——它在我身上比在你身上合适多了。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0407a22cg80efg40begadd7g1b9b3ddb7fe5" version="1">尽管割吧，你不过是在划伤别人的皮肤罢了。</content>
  <content contentuid="hbc8b69dbgb11eg458bgaa7aga2eda5062887" version="1">这张脸快要磨薄了，我还有一千张更好的。</content>
  <content contentuid="h27ee94a1gf942g4180g807fg2d795ecdc444" version="1">专业人士总会给自己留条退路。你呢？</content>
  <content contentuid="h0ca8aa9ag5efag4863g9dc1g4cd13dbd0e7c" version="1">这么多张脸……没有一张是我的。</content>
  <content contentuid="h99a267e2ga000g4c28g891agee14befd8d11" version="1">你以为我是谁，就埋了那个『谁』吧。</content>
  <content contentuid="hc54fab0eg1fcfg4bbfgbda5g328cbff5e774" version="1">那份契约……从来……都是空白的。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha4df2f8ega81cg413agbd4cgfb2af4677d12" version="1">冲我来，别冲我守护的对象。还是说裁决对你来说太刺眼了？</content>
  <content contentuid="hfa679075gbfd9g4b33ga5beg32df2499561c" version="1">踏进光明吧，太阳早已照出你的不堪。</content>
  <content contentuid="h30a2c03dg6b14g4dc8gaa8dg7d9d486d0005" version="1">你连自己投下的阴影都不配拥有。我两样一并照收。</content>
  <content contentuid="hfd3549fcg9048g48d0g8ae9ga40f75e4c3c9" version="1">跪伏于破晓之中吧，否则便站着焚尽。不值一提的东西。</content>
  <content contentuid="hdf93b1e3g228cg49d6g98feg7a26448918d6" version="1">不留半点黑暗，好教你无处可钻。</content>
  <content contentuid="hf28d9c78g0c6dg4a4dg859bg951dfe95b3bb" version="1">诸天庇佑其子民，而他们根本看不见你。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha20cd8f3g4db3g4e1fgb79cgc74116e2bb97" version="1">沐浴阳光，接受审判。你不会喜欢这个裁决的。</content>
  <content contentuid="h82ba7088g78f1g4acdg9e6ag6c6a651b3bdc" version="1">你灼伤了鳞片，但你无法熄灭太阳。</content>
  <content contentuid="h9693ecefgd8efg446agb03fg8c3551d1434b" version="1">尽管打这具躯壳吧——你体内本就从未有过光。</content>
  <content contentuid="haf5c5e59g1b9ag4198ga266g9af830a0827a" version="1">我曾为远比这更微不足道的理由，燃烧得远比此刻更为炽烈。</content>
  <content contentuid="h1e0ab7d5g5693g4014g8110gdad786529b92" version="1">终于……那光芒……放我走了。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd581c0adg1558g4835g864eg8ae55c15a49f" version="1">桥头坠入黑暗……请宽恕他们，诸天在上。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha73c840age828g48e2gbd96gdb59f01b63c2" version="1">我归于……那缔造了我的破晓。</content>
  <content contentuid="h291a9667gdbacg4003g858dgd6e9fccdeb95" version="1">噢，盯着块头大的打？真可爱。我才是这儿的问题所在。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0b2e92fagf30ag412cg9121gd34c32c5606e" version="1">把后背亮给我吧，来啊，我谅你也不敢。</content>
  <content contentuid="h11ec1d8eg909cg482bg8fbagfc268e138e0a" version="1">我跟酒馆里的醉汉交手，他们的走位都比你们强。哈欠。</content>
  <content contentuid="h09ebb47cg199fg4296g9af5ge8dff6ff6ed8" version="1">别往心里去。我既不会记住你的名字，也不会记住你的脸。</content>
  <content contentuid="h6e58d414g7a46g4239gab68ge45e60a538a0" version="1">现在你看得见我了，真可爱，再来试一次啊。</content>
  <content contentuid="h3a2b4c9fge3fcg4788gbca7g2b6d25e4d57b" version="1">位置错了。不过，心意领了。</content>
  <content contentuid="h7e08c9e4ge9dag475eg80f5g4577c56ddd29" version="1">你到底有在使劲吗？连风都开始觉得无聊了。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb6775665g2b5eg484egb036gd924bb7419be" version="1">呵。一道划伤而已。这就是你们最强的本事了？</content>
  <content contentuid="hbab56ff5g8448g4d0fg807dgde69d8397922" version="1">这下总算有点意思了……只是一点点。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd05adef2g9d9fg4275gaa4bge6def0418bca" version="1">有本事就困住我。人人都试过，他们都失手了。</content>
  <content contentuid="h6e6f0094g58efg4056gb7f1ga89e33f0dd6b" version="1">终究……还是困住我了。但风……总会找到另一个。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha93af976gceb2g4b25g960cg35a547590719" version="1">不错的契约……至少风光过一阵。</content>
  <content contentuid="hba0bdbd8g44e9g4d7aga7e5g1af57bf6cfa5" version="1">终于，安静了……</content>
  <content contentuid="h2a5cf8dag50dcg4f7dg8ea8ga4f474f39a53" version="1">来，让我看看你这套Build到底有多能打。</content>
  <content contentuid="h78dcb05cg0c53g41cdga717gd0f892f8bbd7" version="1">来掷个先攻吧！</content>
  <content contentuid="h2c5d9c15ga1d9g4a5agb1f1g6658e782acd3" version="1">要不要下个注？</content>
  <content contentuid="hf12715ccg0bb0g4320gbb10g0e1d4d33bd87" version="1">这一战，注定是史诗级的！</content>
  <content contentuid="h463c3190g1943g4cc2g9ad4g1b5f9ef50375" version="1">就你这等级也想打过这个Boss？太菜了！哈哈哈！！</content>
  <content contentuid="h12fa5306g4a59g4857g89b3g063a34c2733a" version="1">怎么，脸这么黑？</content>
  <content contentuid="hf3191a6cg3c1cg4a1fgbcd6g02fec6e61bd3" version="1">天降陨石，全员团灭。</content>
  <content contentuid="h3fb69a5agfc6ag446cg85ccgfd2c7fc8e1a0" version="1">哭泣可是免费动作哦。</content>
  <content contentuid="h1da3cb4fg63a1g4888g9af6g6533d30912ca" version="1">狂野魔法！</content>
  <content contentuid="h834617eag295bg4599g86e8gc850a67d360e" version="1">接招吧，菜鸡！</content>
  <content contentuid="h826b1598g68a5g4f50g8ef2g48e7f637d249" version="1">这骰子绝对被人动了手脚！</content>
  <content contentuid="h6ef88e95g7a21g4631g9212g188d9b676d5e" version="1">我这才刚热身而已！</content>
  <content contentuid="hd37e8063g46a0g4e37gac69g3fa425016b77" version="1">你小子是在卡BUG吧？</content>
  <content contentuid="h3385d7a6g778fg4c2bg8152g0bfcbda067c8" version="1">全靠一身神装carry，就以为自己很强了？</content>
  <content contentuid="hd1edffc2g4d07g4bb2ga361g89413c6d1767" version="1">接通神经！接通神经！</content>
  <content contentuid="h1580bc60gde67g4570gaa5ag7b63c720688d" version="1">GG……下播了。</content>
  <content contentuid="hc1861d08g1113g4645ga31eg89fb723392a4" version="1">行了行了——求你手下留……</content>
  <content contentuid="hd8b8d996gd048g4f27g84fbg6e0e1073e89a" version="1">呜呼！重骑兵登场啦，istik！</content>
  <content contentuid="haa1295b4g55a4g45afg8115g8ba4f71831c5" version="1">好啦，伙计们，准备好乐一乐了吗？</content>
  <content contentuid="h6d20da43gda42g4f33g8d97gb5baa8a3554e" version="1">什么?！我上次才把棍子擦干净！</content>
  <content contentuid="hfc76a806g83feg4079g92ddg84d9afa68f49" version="1">嘿，看看这是谁啊！又来了一群 istik！哈！</content>
  <content contentuid="h11f4af7fg0460g4755g8b6egac73c28eb51e" version="1">啊啊啊啊！Htak'a！</content>
  <content contentuid="hdc0bc9b8gf65ag412egba91g16a061f1820a" version="1">Shkath zai——为了 Vlaakith！</content>
  <content contentuid="h1115c119g7919g419cg93b3g18a6932370d3" version="1">哈哈，k'chakhi，我早就不在那儿啦！</content>
  <content contentuid="h6d666336g8990g4360gbc12gfabc53785d0b" version="1">Hta'zith！异教徒去死吧！</content>
  <content contentuid="h780489d9g2bbcg498eg8b5cga3f51f0a573a" version="1">专注，Ka'vir，专注……</content>
  <content contentuid="h17420d6eg7a1ag4621g9244g1cb79f221c8f" version="1">就这点本事，istik?！</content>
  <content contentuid="h6d40970eg04d2g4747g8100g4e708ee00c2b" version="1">笑吧笑吧，istik——我照样会回来踢爆你的屁股！</content>
  <content contentuid="h13de297egb9f0g4c84g82afge9ac78682bca" version="1">这是什么鬼，tsk'va?！Kaincha！</content>
  <content contentuid="h5a1daae6gaaabg49abg88e4ga2d8abb38aa1" version="1">Vlaakith……shkath zai……记住我……Ka'vir……白银……</content>
  <content contentuid="h110f9a6dg078cg4616ga4beg8cd82ada62a5" version="1">……这还没完。黑暗者永远与我同在……</content>
  <content contentuid="h13453e08g8cb4g40d1ga184ge82848f0dc6f" version="1">Tsk'va……放开我……</content>
  <content contentuid="h004e82e7ga42ag4260gb7dagfb2e0333693e" version="1">啊啊啊啊啊……</content>
